      "headline": "Chrysler Acquires Simca, Rootes, and Barreiros",
      "text": "In the 1960s, Chrysler expanded internationally by acquiring stakes in Simca (France), Rootes Group (UK), and Barreiros (Spain).",
      "date": "1960"
