      "headline": "Formation of West Bengal Legislative Assembly",
      "text": "The West Bengal Legislative Assembly was formed in 1947 following the partition of Bengal and the independence of India. It was established as the unicameral legislature of the newly created state of West Bengal.",
      "date": "1947"
