      "headline": "Release of 'Blade Runner'",
      "text": "In 1982, the film 'Blade Runner', directed by Ridley Scott and based on Philip K. Dick's novel 'Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?', was released. It became a seminal work in the cyberpunk genre, depicting a dystopian future with advanced technology.",
      "date": "1982"
