      "headline": "Oslo I Accord Signed",
      "text": "On September 13, 1993, the Oslo I Accord was signed in Washington, D.C. This agreement marked the first face-to-face agreement between the government of Israel and the PLO, and it aimed to establish a framework for future relations between the two parties.",
