    },
    {
      "headline": "Marriage to Shah Jahan",
      "text": "On 1612, Arjumand Banu Begum married Prince Khurram, who would later become known as Emperor Shah Jahan. She was given the title Mumtaz Mahal, meaning 'the chosen one of the palace'.",
      "date": "1612"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Empress Consort of the Mughal Empire",
      "text": "In 1628, Shah Jahan ascended to the throne as the fifth Mughal emperor, and Mumtaz Mahal became the empress consort.",
      "date": "1628"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Mumtaz Mahal",
      "text": "Mumtaz Mahal died on 1631-06-17 in Burhanpur, India, during the birth of her fourteenth child.",
