      "text": "King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard was formed in Melbourne, Victoria, Australia in 2010. The band was initially composed of seven members, including Stu Mackenzie, Ambrose Kenny-Smith, Cook Craig, Joey Walker, Lucas Harwood, Michael Cavanagh, and Eric Moore.",
