      "headline": "Dayton Agreement",
      "text": "On December 14, 1995, the Dayton Agreement was signed, officially ending the Bosnian War and establishing the framework for the government of Bosnia and Herzegovina.",
      "date": "1995-12-14"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Kosovo War",
      "text": "The Kosovo War began in February 1998, involving the Federal Republic of Yugoslavia and the Kosovo Liberation Army, and ended with NATO intervention in 1999.",
      "date": "1998-02"
