      "headline": "Planning of the 20 July Plot",
      "text": "In 1943, a group of German officers began planning to assassinate Adolf Hitler and overthrow the Nazi regime. The conspiracy was led by Claus von Stauffenberg and involved several high-ranking Wehrmacht officers.",
      "date": "1943"
    },
