      "headline": "James O. McKinsey's Death",
      "text": "James O. McKinsey, the founder of McKinsey & Company, passed away in 1937, leaving the firm under the leadership of Marvin Bower.",
      "date": "1937"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Marvin Bower's Leadership",
      "text": "Under Marvin Bower's leadership, starting in 1939, McKinsey & Company shifted its focus from accounting to management consulting, establishing many of the firm's core principles and practices.",
      "date": "1939"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Global Expansion",
      "text": "In the 1950s, McKinsey & Company began its global expansion by opening offices in Europe and Asia, becoming one of the first American consulting firms to establish a significant international presence.",
      "date": "1950"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of the 'Generalist' Model",
      "text": "In the 1960s, McKinsey & Company introduced the 'generalist' model, where consultants were trained to work across various industries and functions, enhancing the firm's adaptability and expertise.",
      "date": "1960"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Development of the 7-S Framework",
      "text": "In 1980, McKinsey & Company developed the 7-S Framework, a management model that analyzes organizational effectiveness, which became widely used in strategic planning.",
      "date": "1980"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Adoption of Digital and Technology Consulting",
      "text": "In the 1990s, McKinsey & Company began to incorporate digital and technology consulting into its services, adapting to the changing business landscape.",
      "date": "1990"
    },
    {
      "headline": "McKinsey Global Institute",
      "text": "The McKinsey Global Institute was established in 1990 to conduct research on global economic trends and provide insights to business leaders and policymakers.",
      "date": "1990"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Expansion into Data Analytics",
      "text": "In the 2010s, McKinsey & Company expanded into data analytics, launching McKinsey Analytics to help clients harness big data for strategic decision-making.",
      "date": "2010"
