      "text": "The Treaty of Saint-Germain, signed on September 10, 1919, prohibited the union of Austria with Germany following World War I.",
      "date": "1919-09-10"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Austrian Chancellor Engelbert Dollfuss Assassinated",
      "text": "On July 25, 1934, Austrian Chancellor Engelbert Dollfuss was assassinated by Austrian Nazis in a failed coup attempt.",
