      "headline": "IMAX Enhanced Program Announced",
      "text": "In 2018, IMAX announced the IMAX Enhanced program, a certification and licensing program for consumer electronics products to deliver the IMAX experience at home.",
      "date": "2018"
    }
  ]
}

