      "text": "On June 6, 1944, the Normandy landings, codenamed Operation Neptune, commenced as part of the larger Operation Overlord. This was the largest seaborne invasion in history and marked the beginning of the liberation of German-occupied France (and later western Europe) from Nazi control during World War II.",
