      "text": "In 1968, the Pulitzer Prizes introduced a category for feature photography, recognizing excellence in photojournalism.",
      "date": "1968"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of the Criticism Category",
      "text": "In 1970, the Pulitzer Prizes introduced a category for criticism, acknowledging outstanding critical writing in the arts.",
      "date": "1970"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of the Breaking News Photography Category",
      "text": "In 2000, the Pulitzer Prizes introduced a category for breaking news photography, further expanding the recognition of photojournalistic excellence.",
