      "headline": "Introduction of DTP Vaccine",
      "text": "In the late 1940s, the DTP vaccine, which includes protection against diphtheria, tetanus, and pertussis, was introduced.",
      "date": "1940"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Global Tetanus Vaccination Campaigns",
      "text": "In the late 20th century, global vaccination campaigns were launched to reduce neonatal tetanus, particularly in developing countries.",
      "date": "1980"
