      "headline": "Inception of the Eurovision News Exchange",
      "text": "In 1961, the EBU launched the Eurovision News Exchange, a service that allows member broadcasters to share news footage and reports.",
      "date": "1961"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of the Euroradio Network",
      "text": "The Euroradio Network was introduced in 1967, providing a platform for the exchange of radio content among EBU members.",
      "date": "1967"
