      "headline": "Pune's Role in Indian Independence Movement",
      "text": "In the late 19th and early 20th centuries, Pune became a center for the Indian independence movement, with leaders like Bal Gangadhar Tilak emerging from the city.",
      "date": "1900"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Pune Becomes Part of Independent India",
      "text": "In 1947, Pune became part of the newly independent India following the end of British colonial rule.",
