      "text": "On January 20, 1942, senior Nazi officials gathered at the Wannsee Conference near Berlin to discuss and coordinate the implementation of the 'Final Solution to the Jewish Question.' This meeting formalized the plan for the systematic genocide of Jews across German-occupied Europe.",
