      "headline": "Beginning of Classical Antiquity",
      "text": "Classical antiquity begins around the 8th century BC, marked by the rise of the Greek city-states and the establishment of the Olympic Games in 776 BC.",
      "date": "-0776"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Founding of Rome",
      "text": "According to legend, Rome was founded in 753 BC by Romulus and Remus.",
