      "headline": "Etsy's Pandemic Growth",
      "text": "During the COVID-19 pandemic in 2020, Etsy experienced significant growth as more consumers turned to online shopping, and sellers adapted to the increased demand for handmade masks and other items.",
      "date": "2020"
