      "headline": "Foundation of Wallachia",
      "text": "Wallachia was founded in the early 14th century by Basarab I, who united several local voivodships. The exact date is not clear, but it is generally placed around 1310-1324.",
      "date": "1310"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Battle of Posada",
      "text": "In November 1330, Basarab I defeated the Hungarian King Charles I at the Battle of Posada, securing Wallachia's independence.",
      "date": "1330-11"
