      "text": "On 2004-12-30, a fire broke out in the crowded República Cromañón nightclub in Buenos Aires, Argentina. The fire was caused by indoor pyrotechnics igniting the ceiling. The disaster resulted in the deaths of 194 people and left at least 1,492 injured.",
      "date": "2004-12-30"
    },
    {
