      "text": "The Siege of Antwerp took place from 1584 to 1585, resulting in the city being captured by Spanish forces under the command of Alexander Farnese, Duke of Parma.",
      "date": "1585"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Antwerp Under French Rule",
      "text": "In 1794, Antwerp was annexed by France during the French Revolutionary Wars.",
