      "headline": "Nanking Massacre",
      "text": "From December 13, 1937, to January 1938, Japanese troops committed mass murder and rape in the city of Nanking, China, resulting in the deaths of an estimated 200,000 to 300,000 Chinese civilians.",
      "date": "1937-12-13"
