    {
      "headline": "Joining MI5",
      "text": "In 1958, John le Carré joined the Security Service (MI5), where he conducted interrogations, tapped telephone lines, and supervised agents.",
      "date": "1958"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Transfer to MI6",
      "text": "In 1960, he transferred to the Secret Intelligence Service (MI6), working under diplomatic cover in the British Embassy in Bonn and later in Hamburg.",
