      "text": "In 1964, following the success of his novels, le Carré left MI6 to become a full-time writer.",
      "date": "1964"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy'",
      "text": "In 1974, he published 'Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy', one of his most famous works, which was later adapted into a successful television series and film.",
      "date": "1974"
