      "text": "During the American Revolutionary War (1775-1783), the Mohawk, led by Joseph Brant, allied with the British against the American colonists. This alliance was due to promises of protection and land.",
      "date": "1775"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Post-Revolutionary War Migration",
      "text": "After the American Revolutionary War, many Mohawk people migrated to Canada, settling in areas such as the Six Nations Reserve in Ontario, due to their alliance with the British.",
