      "text": "On December 30, 1922, the Soviet Union was officially formed by a treaty between the Soviet republics of Byelorussia, Russian SFSR (RSFSR), Transcaucasian Federation, and Ukraine, establishing them as constituent republics of the Union of Soviet Socialist Republics.",
      "date": "1922-12-30"
