      "text": "The 1948 Summer Olympics, officially known as the Games of the XIV Olympiad, opened on 29 July 1948 in London, United Kingdom. This marked the first Summer Olympics held since the 1936 Games in Berlin, following a twelve-year hiatus due to World War II.",
