      "headline": "Proposal Details",
      "text": "The Operation Northwoods proposal included various scenarios such as the remote control of civilian aircraft, fabricating the shoot down of a US Air Force fighter, assassinating Cuban immigrants, sinking boats of Cuban refugees, blowing up a U.S. ship, and orchestrating terrorism in U.S. cities.",
      "date": "1962"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Rejection by President Kennedy",
      "text": "President John F. Kennedy rejected the Operation Northwoods proposals. The plan was not implemented, and the documents were later declassified, revealing the extent of the proposed actions.",
      "date": "1962"
    }
  ]
}

