      "headline": "Court Overturns FCC Fine",
      "text": "On July 21, 2008, the Third Circuit Court of Appeals overturned the FCC's fine against CBS, ruling that the FCC acted arbitrarily and capriciously.",
      "date": "2008-07-21"
    },
