      "headline": "Second Nagorno-Karabakh War",
      "text": "A second war erupted, lasting six weeks and resulting in significant territorial gains for Azerbaijan. A ceasefire agreement was signed, brokered by Russia, which included the deployment of Russian peacekeepers.",
