    },
    {
      "headline": "Ceasefire Agreement and Territorial Changes",
      "text": "A ceasefire agreement was signed on November 10, 2020, which resulted in Azerbaijan regaining control over territories surrounding Nagorno-Karabakh and parts of Nagorno-Karabakh itself.",
