    },
    {
      "headline": "Azerbaijan Re-establishes Control",
      "text": "By 2023, Azerbaijan had re-established control over the Nagorno-Karabakh region, following the expulsion of ethnic Armenians and the dissolution of the Republic of Artsakh.",
