      "text": "In 2013, the American Psychiatric Association released the fifth edition of the Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5), which replaced the term Gender Identity Disorder with Gender Dysphoria to remove the stigma associated with the term disorder.",
