    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of Gender Incongruence in ICD",
      "text": "The International Classification of Diseases (ICD) uses the term gender incongruence instead of gender dysphoria, defined as a marked and persistent mismatch between gender identity and assigned gender, regardless of distress or impairment.",
