      "headline": "Sergei Kruglov as Head of NKVD",
      "text": "In 1946, Sergei Kruglov became the head of the NKVD, marking the end of Lavrentiy Beria's leadership.",
      "date": "1946"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Dissolution of NKVD",
      "text": "The NKVD was dissolved in 1946, and its functions were transferred to the Ministry of Internal Affairs (MVD) and the Ministry of State Security (MGB).",
