      "date": "1986"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'L.A. Confidential'",
      "text": "Curtis Hanson's 'L.A. Confidential' (1997) is a critically acclaimed neo-noir film that revisits the classic noir setting of 1950s Los Angeles with a modern twist.",
      "date": "1997"
    },
