      "text": "The Rolling Plan was introduced from 1978 to 1980, replacing the Fifth Plan, due to a change in government.",
      "date": "1978"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Sixth Five-Year Plan",
      "text": "The Sixth Five-Year Plan was initiated in 1980, focusing on poverty alleviation and employment generation.",
