      "text": "The Eighth Five-Year Plan was implemented in 1992, focusing on human resource development and economic liberalization.",
      "date": "1992"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Ninth Five-Year Plan",
      "text": "The Ninth Five-Year Plan started in 1997, aiming to prioritize agriculture and rural development.",
      "date": "1997"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Tenth Five-Year Plan",
      "text": "The Tenth Five-Year Plan was launched in 2002, focusing on doubling per capita income and reducing poverty.",
      "date": "2002"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Eleventh Five-Year Plan",
      "text": "The Eleventh Five-Year Plan began in 2007, aiming for inclusive growth and improving education and health sectors.",
      "date": "2007"
    },
