      "text": "The Pulwama attack dealt a severe blow to India–Pakistan relations, consequently resulting in the 2019 India–Pakistan military standoff.",
      "date": "2019-02"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Indian Investigations Identify Accused",
      "text": "Subsequent investigations by India identified 19 accused individuals connected to the Pulwama attack.",
      "date": "2019"
    },
